{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27801","headline":"南涧寺 · 欧阳衮","name":"南涧寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春寺无人乱鸟啼，藤萝阴磴野僧迷。\n云藏古壁遗龙象，草没香台抱鹿麛。\n松籁泠泠疑梵呗，柳烟历历见招提。\n爲耽寂乐亲禅侣，莫怪闲行费马蹄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}